
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>Human Bingo | Community Games Bank</title>

  <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
  <script src="game.js" defer></script>
</head>

<body>

  <header class="header">
    <a href="/" class="brand">
      Community Games Bank <span>✳</span>
    </a>

    <span class="game-label">NETWORKING GAME</span>
  </header>

  <main>

    <section class="welcome">
      <p class="eyebrow">MEET PEOPLE. DISCOVER CONNECTIONS.</p>

      <h1>Let's play <span>Human Bingo!</span></h1>

      <p class="intro">
        Move around, meet new people, discover interesting things
        about them and complete your bingo card.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="entry-options">

      <article class="entry-card">
        <div class="card-icon">🎯</div>

        <h2>Organize a game</h2>

        <p>
          Create a networking session, choose a template,
          customize your prompts and invite participants.
        </p>

        <form id="createGameForm">

          <label for="organizerName">Your name</label>
          <input
            type="text"
            id="organizerName"
            placeholder="Enter your name"
            required
          >

          <label for="gameTemplate">Choose a template</label>
          <select id="gameTemplate" required>
            <option value="general">General Networking</option>
            <option value="technology">Technology & Innovation</option>
            <option value="entrepreneurship">Entrepreneurship</option>
            <option value="students">University & Students</option>
            <option value="career">Career Networking</option>
            <option value="icebreakers">Fun & Icebreakers</option>
            <option value="custom">Create my own</option>
          </select>

          <button type="submit" class="button button-dark">
            Create a game →
          </button>

        </form>
      </article>

      <article class="entry-card">
        <div class="card-icon">👋</div>

        <h2>Join a game</h2>

        <p>
          Have a room code from your organizer?
          Enter it below to join the networking fun.
        </p>

        <form id="joinGameForm">

          <label for="participantName">Your name</label>
          <input
            type="text"
            id="participantName"
            placeholder="Enter your name"
            required
          >

          <label for="roomCode">Game room code</label>
          <input
            type="text"
            id="roomCode"
            placeholder="e.g. BINGO25"
            maxlength="10"
            required
          >

          <button type="submit" class="button button-light">
            Join the game →
          </button>

        </form>
      </article>

    </section>

    <section class="rules">
      <p class="eyebrow">HOW TO PLAY</p>

      <h2>Meet 20 people. Complete your card.</h2>

      <ol>
        <li>Join a game using the room code provided by your organizer.</li>
        <li>Receive a bingo card containing 20 different networking prompts.</li>
        <li>Move around and find people who match each prompt.</li>
        <li>Enter the person's name and mark the matching square.</li>
        <li>Find a different person for every square. You cannot complete a square with yourself.</li>
        <li>Complete all 20 squares before the game ends!</li>
      </ol>

      <p class="rules-note">
        Be friendly, introduce yourself and ask questions.
        The goal is to make meaningful connections, not just finish first!
      </p>
    </section>

  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>Community Games Bank ✳ · Good people. Good games. Great memories.</p>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>






